    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W0454 = Swedish national extension of W04 SNOMED CT 60594001, qualified by place
        (butiks-/handels-/serviceområde, trade/service area) and activity (vitalaktivitet, vital
        activity). Target SNOMED CT 4244882 = (concept_code 60594001), the only standard SNOMED CT concept for
        this mechanism, crosswalk-verified from bare ICD-10 W04 via Athena Maps-to edge (ICD10 45756246
